1
00:00:00,005 --> 00:00:04,045
Can participants do this without
following your approach?

2
00:00:04,045 --> 00:00:09,705
I don’t mean disrespecting you or
refusing to listen.

3
00:00:09,705 --> 00:00:20,065
I mean: can you allow ways of
working you don’t agree with?

4
00:00:20,065 --> 00:00:24,485
At least let those things emerge.

5
00:00:24,485 --> 00:00:27,985
We don’t have to keep them. Just
try them.

6
00:00:27,985 --> 00:00:30,731
That’s the key: give them a try.

7
00:00:30,731 --> 00:00:35,443
If time, cost, and everyone’s
willingness allow—can we try?

8
00:00:35,443 --> 00:00:40,003
I mean making the footage, not
editing it afterward.

9
00:00:40,003 --> 00:00:42,523
Can we do that during the actual
filming?

10
00:00:42,523 --> 00:00:46,003
Of course. It’s already very open.

11
00:00:46,003 --> 00:00:47,803
Don’t be so absolute about that.
